  first | exact @GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.SW.ThW.abs_det_gM_all | exact GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.SW.ThW.abs_det_gM_all | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.SW.ThW.abs_det_gM_all <;> assumption)
